SYMATTR Value {max(Lloop,1e-15)}
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser={Rloop}
FLAG 656 112 bus
FLAG 656 192 rail
SYMBOL ind 928 96 R0
SYMATTR InstName Lload
SYMATTR Value {Lload}
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser={Rload}
FLAG 944 112 rail
FLAG 944 192 sw
